TY  - JOUR
TI  - Estimating and simulating with a random utility random opportunity model of job choice. Presentation and application to Belgium
AU  - Capéau, Bart
AU  - Decoster, André
AU  - Dekkers, Gijs
VL  - 9
IS  - 2
